%U A399146 35703,44118,54350,66766,81788,99932,121783,148055,179567,217296,262369,316131,380121,456167
%N A399146 G.f.: (Sum_{k>=1} x^(k^4)/(1 - x^(k^4))) / Product_{k>=1} (1 - x^k).
%C A399146 In general, if m > 1 and g.f. = (Sum_{k>=1} x^(k^m)/(1 - x^(k^m))) / Product_{k>=1} (1 - x^k), then a(n) ~ exp(Pi*sqrt(2*n/3)) * (zeta(m) / (Pi * 2^(3/2) * sqrt(n)) + Gamma(1/m) * zeta(1/m) / (m * 2^(2 - 1/(2*m)) * 3^(1/2 - 1/(2*m)) * Pi^(1/m) * n^(1 - 1/(2*m)))). The formula is valid even for m=1, if we use the limit m->1, then a(n) ~ exp(Pi*sqrt(2*n/3)) * (log(6*n/Pi^2) + 2*gamma) / (4*Pi*sqrt(2*n)), where gamma is A001620.
%H A399146 Vaclav Kotesovec, <a href="/A399146/b399146.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..10000</a>
%F A399146 a(n) = Sum_{k=1..n} A063775(k)*A000041(n-k).
%F A399146 a(n) ~ exp(Pi*sqrt(2*n/3)) * (Pi^3 / (45*2^(5/2)*sqrt(n)) + Gamma(1/4)*zeta(1/4) / (2^(31/8)*3^(3/8)*Pi^(1/4)*n^(7/8))).
%t A399146 nmax = 50; CoefficientList[Series[Sum[x^(k^4)/(1 - x^(k^4)), {k, 1, Floor[nmax^(1/4)] + 1}] / Product[1 - x^k, {k, 1, nmax}], {x, 0, nmax}], x]
%Y A399146 Cf. A006128, A073336, A264392.
%Y A399146 Cf. A063775, A000041.
%K A399146 nonn,new
%O A399146 0,3
